+
+Scope: the fresh source copies of `semantic.k`, `verification.k`, and `spec.k`.
+There are no generated helper K source files.
+
+## Syntax, configuration, and attributes
+
+| ID | Source | Declaration | Attributes / role | Audit result |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
